listing:   ledger.cc
toolchain: g++ (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0; GNU gdb (Ubuntu 15.1-1ubuntu1~24.04.1) 15.1
command:   g++ -std=c++20 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror -O0 -g ledger.cc -o ledger; ./ledger & sleep 2; gdb -q -batch -p <pid> -ex 'info threads' -ex 'thread apply all bt' -ex 'thread apply all frame apply all -s print from.name' (and &from.m, to.name, &to.m)
date:      2026-10-09T20:11:04Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container), 4 CPUs visible
exit code: 0
note:      the dump is trimmed: gdb start-up lines and the C++ library's thread-start frames are replaced by [...]; addresses vary per run
